{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"西環石山街私家車撞鐵欄後翻側　無人受傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-WESTERN-261117-06.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】西環有私家車失事，撞向鐵欄後翻側，無人受傷。</p><p>司機在現場協助調查。凌晨零時許，一輛私家車沿石山街往士美菲路方向行駛，駛至士美菲路巿政大廈對開時懷疑失控，撞向路邊鐵欄後翻側，車上司機及兩名男乘客自行離開車廂，警方正調查意外原因。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:25:23.858594+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T23:50:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:48:53.001723+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T00:18:48.571538+00:00","content_hash":"20f71b4cb81f8dd98e364d20154835115e2e7543d07d7aa0fa8e84d329505510","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:25:23.858594+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}